class ResolveBranchIdByNameAnyWorkspaceStep(SqlRelationPublisherStep[BranchId]):
    """L0: Resolve a branch ``sys_id`` by branch name without workspace filter.

    Used when the read path has a domain but no known ``workspace_id`` (for
    example, a non-versioned read transaction that issues a history query
    against a domain whose ``workspace_id`` attribute was never set on the
    domain class). The domain's branch table is already
    domain-scoped, so a unique lookup by ``name`` (with ``sys_deleted = false``)
    is well-defined as long as no two workspaces share a branch name in this
    domain.
