    """Exact git-history import needs oracle-style raw row replay plus publish.

    A single git commit is one versioned revision. For SQLite this path must not
    lower to a multi-round-trip staged publish for every commit; otherwise large
    histories fall from oracle-like throughput to a few commits per second.
    """

